msgstr ""
"X neizdevās palaist šajā datorā. Vai vēlaties palaist VNC, lai savienotos ar "
"šo datoru no cita datora un veiktu grafisko instalēšanu, vai turpināt ar "
"teksta režīma instalēšanu?"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:112
msgid "An error occurred while activating your storage configuration."
msgstr "Aktivizējot krātuves konfigurāciju, radās kļūda."

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:119
msgid ""
"There is a problem with your existing storage configuration or your initial "
"settings, for example a kickstart file. You must resolve this matter before "
"the installation can proceed. There is a shell available for use which you "
"can access by pressing ctrl-alt-f1 and then ctrl-b 2.\n"
"\n"
"Once you have resolved the issue you can retry the storage scan. If you do "
"not fix it you will have to exit the installer."
msgstr ""
"Radusies problēma ar esošo krātuves konfigurāciju vai sākotnējiem "
"iestatījumiem, piemēram, kickstart failu. Tā jāatrisina, pirms instalēšana "
"var turpināties. Ir pieejama čaula, kurai var piekļūt, nospiežot ctrl-alt-f1 "
"un tad ctrl-b 2.\n"
"\n"
"Kad problēma būs atrisināta, varat mēģināt krātuvi skenēt vēlreiz. Ja to "
"neatrisināsiet, būs jāiziet no instalētāja."

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:128
msgctxt "GUI|Storage Detailed Error Dialog"
msgid "_Exit Installer"
msgstr "_Iziet no instalētāja"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:129
msgctxt "GUI|Storage Detailed Error Dialog"
msgid "_Retry"
msgstr "_Mēģināt vēlreiz"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:136
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The ISO image %s has a size which is not a multiple of 2048 bytes.  This may "
"mean it was corrupted on transfer to this computer.\n"
"\n"
"It is recommended that you exit and abort your installation, but you can "
"choose to continue if you think this is in error. Would you like to continue "
"using this image?"
msgstr ""
"ISO tēla %s izmērs nav 2048 baitu daudzkārtnis.  Tas var nozīmēt, ka tas "
"tika bojāts, pārsūtot uz šo datoru.\n"
"\n"
"Ieteicams iziet un pārtraukt instalēšanu, bet varat izvēlēties turpināt, ja "
"domājat, ka tā ir kļūda. Vai vēlaties turpināt lietot šo tēlu?"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:150
msgid ""
"The installer has tried to mount the installation image, but cannot find it "
"on the hard drive.\n"
"\n"
"Should I try again to locate the image?"
msgstr ""
"Instalētājs mēģināja montēt instalēšanas tēlu, bet nevar to atrast cietajā "
"diskā.\n"
"\n"
"Vai mēģināt atrast tēlu vēlreiz?"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:161
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The group '%s' is required for this installation. This group does not exist. "
"This is a fatal error and installation will be aborted."
msgstr ""
"Šai instalācijai nepieciešama grupa „%s”. Šī grupa neeksistē. Tā ir fatāla "
"kļūda, un instalēšana tiks pārtraukta."

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:167
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have specified that the group '%s' should be installed.  This group does "
"not exist.  Would you like to ignore this group and continue with "
"installation?"
msgstr ""
"Norādīts, ka jāinstalē grupa „%s”.  Šī grupa neeksistē.  Vai vēlaties "
"ignorēt šo grupu un turpināt instalēšanu?"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:172
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have specified that the group '%s' should be excluded from "
"installation.  This group does not exist.  Would you like to ignore this "
"group and continue with installation?"
msgstr ""
"Norādīts, ka grupa „%s” jāizslēdz no instalēšanas.  Šī grupa neeksistē.  Vai "
"vēlaties ignorēt šo grupu un turpināt instalēšanu?"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:193
msgid ""
"Some packages, groups or modules are broken, the installation will be "
"aborted."
msgstr ""
"Dažas pakotnes, grupas vai moduļi ir bojāti, instalēšana tiks pārtraukta."

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:199
msgid "Would you like to ignore this and continue with installation?"
msgstr "Vai vēlaties to ignorēt un turpināt instalēšanu?"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:206
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Stream was not specified for a module without a default stream. This is a "
"fatal error and installation will be aborted. The details of this error "
"are:\n"
"\n"
"%(exception)s"
msgstr ""
"Modulim bez noklusējuma straumes nav norādīta straume. Tā ir fatāla kļūda, "
"un instalēšana tiks pārtraukta. Kļūdas informācija:\n"
"\n"
"%(exception)s"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:214
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Multiple streams have been specified for a single module. This is a fatal "
"error and installation will be aborted. The details of this error are:\n"
"\n"
"%(exception)s"
msgstr ""
"Vienam modulim norādītas vairākas straumes. Tā ir fatāla kļūda, un "
"instalēšana tiks pārtraukta. Kļūdas informācija:\n"
"\n"
"%(exception)s"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:222
#, python-format
msgid ""
"There was an error running the kickstart script at line %(lineno)s.  This is "
"a fatal error and installation will be aborted.  The details of this error "
"are:\n"
"\n"
"%(details)s"
msgstr ""
"Izpildot kickstart skriptu %(lineno)s. rindā, radās kļūda.  Tā ir fatāla "
"kļūda, un instalēšana tiks pārtraukta.  Kļūdas informācija:\n"
"\n"
"%(details)s"

